<title>USA: Reynolds Metals sees gain from coal sale.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals sees gain from coal sale.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reynolds Metals Co said Thursday that it expects to realize a $0.13 per share gain from the sale of its coal properties in western Kentucky to a unit of Henderson Farm &amp; Coal Property LLC.</p>
<p>Reynolds said the sale was completed effective today.</p>
